<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>Moonwolf accused of littering leaves around Norrath!                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">Was a long day, a day in which I worked at a mundane job and had to relive the glory moments of the guild via harried fonecalls from officers - but here's the official nooz:<br><br>1.  Adon = dangly noodle.  Now he can rez our rangers faster than ever before  ;)<br><br>Water Sprinkler of Nem Ankh <br>Stats: Damage: 20 - Dly: 32 - Wt: 8 - Type: 1hb - Damage Per Second: 12.81<br>Attributes: STA+10 CHA+15 WIS+25 MANA+100 SV DISEASE+10 SV COLD+10 SV FIRE+10 SV MAGIC+10 <br>Effect: Reviviscence<br><br><br>We've read this.  What we didn't read is that some lootwhore assmunch Ninja'd a set of GoFM's and possibly other items off the kill amidst the confusion/WOOT'ing.  <br><br>While we think you're incredibly lame, we do kinda feel sorry for you that the only way you talentless lootstealing freaks can get stuff is to rip others off when they succeed.  /rude<br><br>2.  Grats to MOONWOLF on his brand new sparkly leafblower.  Yep, that's right - another SoF first - 2 epics in one day.  ;)<br><br>For those that haven't seen the stats:<br><br>Nature Walkers Scimitar<br>Stats: Damage: 20 - Dly: 30 - Wt: 3 - Type: 1hs - Damage Per Second: 13.67<br>Attributes: STR+15 STA+15 WIS+20 HP+10 MANA+90 SV POISON+10 SV DISEASE+10 SV COLD+10 SV FIRE+10 SV MAGIC+10 <br>Effect: Wrath of Nature (62% snare, 1650 DOT over 3 minutes)<br><br><br>3.  Venril Sathir = that dead guy from Karnors.  <br><br>Grats out to:<br><br>Shaiela on her wizard epic staff and her:<br><br>Diamond Encrusted Staff<br>Races: ALL - Classes: WIZ (MAGIC)<br>Stats: Damage: 12 - Dly: 36 - Wt: 10 - Type: 2hb - Damage Per Second: 6.94<br>Attributes: INT+12 MANA+50 <br>Effect: Elemental Armor<br><br>/Furthergrats out to Greimalk on his:<br><br>Waters of Impenitrable Aura<br>Races: ALL - Classes: CLR (LORE - MAGIC)<br>Stats: Damage: 12 - Dly: 36 - Wt: 10 - Type: 2hb - Damage Per Second: 6.94<br>Effect: Resist Magic<br><br>. . . ever get the feeling that some days VS is just... well... cheap?  Where's the cobalt?  Gimme something useful.  Sheesh.  LOL.<br><br>Along the way to VS, Skogan accidentally killed his Karnors PAWDUSTER, so we're looking forward to long protracted painful Chardok camps for him next week.  Go Skoggie  ;)<br><br>And that wraps up our broadcast day.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            